msgstr "Landasan berlepas kecemasan. Su-30 dan CH-4 masih di darat."

msgid "The swarm is in the air. It does not finish the towers."
msgstr "Kawanan di udara. Ia tidak memusnahkan menara."

msgid "The tank column is on the road. Freeze it, then break it."
msgstr "Barisan kereta kebal di jalan. Bekukannya, kemudian patahkannya."

msgid "The wharf is up. Take it to the second level."
msgstr "Dermaga berdiri. Naikkan ke tahap kedua."

